1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,400
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:27,800
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,080
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,760
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:48,440
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,760
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:58,600
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,520
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:04,160
=Episode 22=

12
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,120
Easy.

13
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:18,879
Weiyue.

14
00:01:29,959 --> 00:01:31,159
Weiyue,

15
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,280
give me ten minutes.

16
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,560
I'll explain.

17
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:36,439
Can we just talk, please?

18
00:01:36,439 --> 00:01:37,239
Talk about what?

19
00:01:40,079 --> 00:01:41,560
I know you always protect your own.

20
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:44,879
Then take your guard
and get out of Xingyun Sect.

21
00:01:45,319 --> 00:01:47,200
And never show your face
in front of me again.

22
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:49,079
You know I won't leave.

23
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:52,159
You're still worried
about Yinbei's safety, aren't you?

24
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:56,640
Your Highness, you truly are
such a devoted, caring

25
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,680
guardian of the realm.

26
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,159
Rest assured.

27
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:03,480
I'll win the Xingyun Sect contest.

28
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:08,439
I promise Xingyun Sect will never fall
into Yuanding's hands.

29
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:09,479
But

30
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:12,479
it will never become
Yinbei's force either.

31
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,159
I'm not leaving.

32
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,360
Get lost!

33
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,319
Feng Weiyue,

34
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:23,280
trust me one more time, please.

35
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:26,199
There's definitely something off
about Ye's death.

36
00:02:26,879 --> 00:02:29,919
If you don't want Ye to have died
for nothing,

37
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:30,759
then we...

38
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:33,520
We do an autopsy and take a look.

39
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,599
What?

40
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,719
Mo Yuya,

41
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,439
you want her to cut open Ye?

42
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,879
Are you trying to rub her nose in it?

43
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,080
Get out!

44
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,120
If you don't leave now,

45
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,000
don't blame me for what happens.

46
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:47,800
Fine!

47
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:51,199
Then show me what you've got.

48
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,560
If you want to act tough,
do it somewhere else!

49
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:57,520
Mo Yuya.

50
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:02,000
Ye was one of the few people
in this world

51
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:05,879
who was like family to me.

52
00:03:07,879 --> 00:03:08,960
You killed him.

53
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,360
There's no chance for us anymore.

54
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:17,440
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

55
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,960
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

56
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,439
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

57
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,240
You won't leave?

58
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,560
Then I will.

59
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,840
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

60
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,879
Don't leave.

61
00:03:31,439 --> 00:03:32,639
I'll go.

62
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,439
I'll go.

63
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,600
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

64
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:40,520
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

65
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:44,360
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

66
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:47,520
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

67
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:51,320
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

68
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:54,120
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

69
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,960
♪This love remains unchanged♪

70
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,760
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

71
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:03,760
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

72
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:07,800
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

73
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:10,600
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

74
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:14,320
♪How can I bear a sweet dream
turning into doom♪

75
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,439
(Interesting.)

76
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:20,879
(Looks like the yearning gu
has begun to take effect.)

77
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,200
♪I don't regret that vow♪

78
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:28,160
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪

79
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:36,279
Ye.

80
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:38,000
Boss, let me fill it up.

81
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,639
Hey, that's enough.

82
00:04:39,639 --> 00:04:40,560
You know what?

83
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:42,639
I'm actually grateful
for that research project of ours.

84
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,040
It brought us to ancient times,

85
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,759
where we got to taste ancient wine.

86
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,399
It's quite good. Let's drink.

87
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:49,040
- Cheers.
- Bottoms up.

88
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:55,040
- Great wine.
- Great indeed.

89
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,439
Ye.

90
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:59,079
Boss, try these ancient melon seeds.

91
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,920
I don't want to spend my life
shelling seeds here.

92
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:05,160
Ye, you still owe me hotpot.

93
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:06,920
And you owe me that...
What was it again?

94
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,279
Clams and beer. Remember?

95
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,759
There are clams, but no beer.

96
00:05:12,879 --> 00:05:14,759
I want crayfish too.

97
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:19,240
♪This love remains unchanged♪

98
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:21,880
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

99
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,960
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

100
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:30,240
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

101
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,880
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

102
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:35,680
♪How can I bear a sweet dream
turning into doom♪

103
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:39,720
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

104
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:43,880
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

105
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,760
♪I don't regret that vow♪

106
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:49,840
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪

107
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:53,360
♪We can continue what we had
in the afterlife♪

108
00:05:53,759 --> 00:05:54,600
(Mo Yuya,)

109
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:56,480
(why did you do this?)

110
00:05:57,880 --> 00:06:00,040
♪The moonlight is as before,
my heart still lingers♪

111
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,560
♪Let heaven witness this love♪

112
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,680
(Feng Weiyue,)

113
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,639
(trust me one more time, please.)

114
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,480
(There's something off
about Ye's death.)

115
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,600
I only struck him lightly.

116
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,160
And then...

117
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:12,959
Struck him lightly?

118
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:17,120
How could one light strike kill him?

119
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:19,040
Mo Yuya,

120
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:21,720
how did Ye ever wrong you?

121
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:34,200
(Pharmacology Notes)

122
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,720
(It's the voice recorder I gave him.)

123
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:05,759
Weiyue,

124
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,360
I know you may never forgive me.

125
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:12,920
But if you still have even the slightest
feeling for me,

126
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:17,240
and you came to my quarters,
found this recorder,

127
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,040
and heard this message,

128
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:21,600
then heaven has pitied me

129
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,519
and given me a chance to explain.

130
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:29,240
That day, I was angry that
Yuan Qing gave you the hairpins.

131
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:31,399
I went to confront him.

132
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:36,240
When he was losing and about to retreat,

133
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:40,120
he secretly threw a colorless powder
at me.

134
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,800
Once I breathed it in,

135
00:07:43,079 --> 00:07:45,800
my blood surged, and every meridian
in me went out of control.

136
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,199
The powder settled on my robes.

137
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,360
I had it investigated afterwards

138
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:58,800
and found it very similar to the powder
I once came into contact with

139
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:01,160
when I fought the assassin, Gu Nanke.

140
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,360
(There is a smell to it.)

141
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,800
(But I've never come into contact
with this poison.)

142
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,319
(Why does it feel so familiar?)

143
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:11,160
And hairpins

144
00:08:12,199 --> 00:08:14,199
were one of Gu Nanke's
signature weapons.

145
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:19,319
Yuan Qing must be connected to Gu Nanke.

146
00:08:20,199 --> 00:08:21,720
His identity is unusual.

147
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:24,399
When Ye came to see me that day,

148
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,399
his temper suddenly flared.

149
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:30,519
I also suspect that Ye's death

150
00:08:31,319 --> 00:08:32,679
is connected to Yuan Qing.

151
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,039
(Get lost!)

152
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,000
Given how much you trust him,

153
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:42,679
I don't know if you're still willing
to trust me.

154
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:44,639
But

155
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:49,240
we promised never to doubt each other.

156
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:52,279
I only want to tell you everything
honestly.

157
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:56,039
Whether you believe me is up to you.

158
00:09:02,639 --> 00:09:06,600
(With his abilities, Yuan Qing could
certainly have done it.)

159
00:09:10,159 --> 00:09:12,000
(No. I have to find out the truth.)

160
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,960
(I can't let Ye die without a reason.)

161
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,919
(Forgive me, Ye.)

162
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:27,639
(I don't want you to die
without knowing why.)

163
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:28,360
(Ye Yuntian)

164
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:31,840
(So today, I have to perform an autopsy
on you.)

165
00:09:32,879 --> 00:09:35,879
(If only to put my mind at rest.)

166
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,240
Weiyue.

167
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:54,639
Weiyue, you still won't give up?

168
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,600
You won't believe the facts
in front of you,

169
00:09:58,159 --> 00:09:59,639
but you'd rather believe Mo Yuya?

170
00:09:59,679 --> 00:10:01,399
Yuan Qing, what are you doing here?

171
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:11,600
If there really are traces of drugs
in Ye's body,

172
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:14,759
then his death needs
a new investigation.

173
00:10:15,399 --> 00:10:17,039
I have to know the truth.

174
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,039
Don't you know
the dead should be left in peace?

175
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,759
Even in modern times,

176
00:10:25,759 --> 00:10:28,039
an autopsy helps the living live on

177
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,279
and the dead rest better, doesn't it?

178
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:39,600
Feng Weiyue, I told you to stop.

179
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,120
Do you not understand what I'm saying?

180
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,440
No digging.

181
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:54,519
So Mo Yuya didn't lie to me.

182
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,360
It was you all along,

183
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:01,240
Yuan Qing.

184
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,200
Your Highness,

185
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:13,720
we found out

186
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,360
about Yuan Qing's identity.

187
00:11:15,559 --> 00:11:16,840
He's the crown prince of Yuanding.

188
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,799
The crown prince of Yuanding?

189
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:26,080
I remember it being someone else.

190
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:27,720
That's right.

191
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:30,320
The crown prince never contended
for anything,

192
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,759
but a few months ago,

193
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,879
he rose out of nowhere,

194
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,879
stepped into the spotlight,

195
00:11:35,279 --> 00:11:36,399
and dealt with his rivals

196
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:38,000
with ruthless efficiency
in the shortest time,

197
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:40,200
winning the Emperor's favor.

198
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,600
And so he was made crown prince.

199
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:47,519
So his scheming runs deep.

200
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:52,840
If he came simply for Xingyun Sect,

201
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:57,200
why does he avoid competing
within the sect

202
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:01,279
and instead, do everything to help Weiyue
win the Sect Master seat?

203
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,639
Does Weiyue...

204
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:12,159
So that's his game.

205
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:14,440
Your Highness, what do you mean?

206
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:20,399
He's Weiyue's first love.

207
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,639
He doesn't need to expose himself

208
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,639
by competing for the Sect Master seat.

209
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:28,320
He only needs to turn Weiyue against me,

210
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,559
then help her win the seat.

211
00:12:32,399 --> 00:12:33,440
And then

212
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:37,440
everything falls into his hands.

213
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:47,320
I thought I had the whole situation
under control.

214
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:50,879
(Ye Yuntian)
And yet you still found out.

215
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,600
It's you.

216
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,759
I'll kill you!

217
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,960
You overestimate yourself.

218
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:05,320
Why?

219
00:13:06,399 --> 00:13:08,279
Ye was one of us.

220
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:10,679
Why did you kill him?

221
00:13:12,679 --> 00:13:14,080
That old man

222
00:13:14,639 --> 00:13:15,960
is worth more dead.

223
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,799
Don't look at me like that.

224
00:13:20,279 --> 00:13:23,000
In some ways, you and I are the same.

225
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,559
Like hell we are!

226
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:27,360
I'm nothing like you.

227
00:13:34,679 --> 00:13:37,159
I've hinted at it countless times,
openly and otherwise,

228
00:13:38,159 --> 00:13:39,720
but you still can't remember.

229
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,240
What do you mean?

230
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:48,519
What if I told you that three years ago,

231
00:13:48,679 --> 00:13:50,200
your identity was Gu Nanke?

232
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:13,440
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

233
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:15,960
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

234
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,000
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

235
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,800
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

236
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:26,800
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

237
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:29,600
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

238
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:35,200
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

239
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:40,480
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

240
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:43,800
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

241
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:47,600
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

242
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:50,160
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

243
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:54,320
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

244
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:57,040
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

245
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,960
♪This love remains unchanged♪

246
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:02,480
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

247
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,640
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

248
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:10,760
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

249
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:13,520
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

250
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:15,400
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

251
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:17,160
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

252
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:20,520
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

253
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:24,840
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

254
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:27,200
♪I don't regret that vow♪

255
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:30,680
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
